:: Octavia \[Event\] - Two Camps One Chief - Settlement Fight [bg-settlement]
<h1 class="ptitle">SETTLEMENT GATES</h1>
<br />
Octavia is already gone by the time you reach the wall — hers is a fight you can't fight for her now. Yours is right in front of you.
<br /><br />
<center>
    <<image 'people/octavia/two_camps_settlement1.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
Whoever timed this knew exactly when your strongest fighter would be somewhere else. That's not comforting. It's also not going to stop what's climbing your fence.
<br /><br />
<<link 'Meet them at the wall'>>
    <<set $game.death_reason = 'overrun at the gate'>>
    <<generateEnemies 4>>
    <<set $fight.skipEnding = true>>
    <<fight $enemies 'Octavia [Event] - Two Camps One Chief - Aftermath' 'Dead'>>
<</link>>
